 I'm here to help you resolve the CORS (Cross-Origin Resource Sharing) error you're encountering when using Next.js with a WordPress backend. CORS is a security feature that prevents your web application from making requests to a different domain than the one it was loaded from, unless certain conditions are met.

To fix this issue, follow these steps:

